  'copilotAdoption.adoptionFunnel.lostHere': '{count} lost here',
  'copilotAdoption.adoptionFunnel.dropHelp.topTier': '{lost} of the {previous} users at "{previousLabel}" have not reached "{stage}". Reaching "{stage}" is the top tier of engagement, not a target for everyone: users at "{previousLabel}" have already formed a habit and need no action. Read this as the size of your advocate pool, not as a loss.',
  'copilotAdoption.adoptionFunnel.dropHelp.loss': '{lost} of the {previous} users at "{previousLabel}" did not reach "{stage}". The percentage is the conversion from the stage immediately above, not from the top of the funnel. The biggest single drop is where enablement effort should go.',
