  'copilotAdoption.adoptionFunnel.caption': 'Each stage is a subset of the one above it. The figure on the right is the conversion from the stage immediately above, not from the top - the biggest single drop is where the effort should go. The last step is shown in grey rather than red because it is not a loss: everyone who reaches the stage above it has already formed a habit. Hover any stage name for how it is counted, or any figure for the detail.',
